    <title>Vol.65 边走边聊思密达：2026年第一口吃得有点香</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6973298e109824f9e1204d58</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6973298e109824f9e1204d58</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Jan 2026 08:16:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkmnKhLMO1v-AmOVaGrPJnQI0cL4.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>今年1月份，阿韭们又双叒去韩国看剧啦！我们此次的六人团伙，在有限的元旦假期里，精挑细选了六部剧——一起看了《红磨坊》《长靴皇后》《死亡笔记》，又分组看了《不眠之夜》《粉丝来信》《阴间大法师》，都收获了非常快乐的体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>是戏剧一次次将我们拽出国门，在韩国“开地图"似乎已经变成了越来越日常的事情，期待下一站我们又刷新在新的剧场~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期涉及剧目及卡司：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《不眠之夜》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《红磨坊》 洪光浩 金智宇 郑善雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>《粉丝来信》金钟九 金利贤 金赫拉</span></p><span></span><p><span>《长靴皇后》申载凡 姜泓锡</span></p><span></span><p><span>《死亡笔记》林圭亨 李灿多</span></p><span></span><p><span>《阴间大法师》（Beetlejuice）金俊秀 洪娜贤</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 《不眠之夜》：刚开业都好看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 《红磨坊》：洪光浩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> 《粉丝来信》：更细腻的粉丝来信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 《长靴皇后》：返场鼓掌五分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">44:07</a> 《死亡笔记》：年轻真好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3342">55:42</a> 《Beetlejuice》：金俊秀！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3896">64:56</a> 《红磨坊》二刷</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：玥玥/阿宁/彬彬/豆芽/阿夏/过过</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：玥玥</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：彬彬</span></p><span></span><p><span>字幕：过过</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：过过/阿宁</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【音乐来源】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Glenn Miller Orchestra - Moonlight Becomes You</span></p><span></span><p><span>Benny Goodman and His Orchestra - Sandman</span></p><span></span><p><span>金智宇 - Firework《红磨坊》</span></p><span></span><p><span>Raise you up《长靴皇后》</span></p><span></span><p><span>金圣喆 高恩成 - Playing this game《死亡笔记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>遗稿集《粉丝来信》</span></p><span></span><p><span>金俊秀 - 《阴间大法师》</span></p><span></span><p><span>洪光浩 - Hurricane 《死亡笔记》</span></p>]]></description>
