  <item>
    <title>Vol.64 2025阿那亚戏剧节：这次我们聊了二十多个戏！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689ee9c451528e172ad41eee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689ee9c451528e172ad41eee</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 08:21:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqUK0B1ARX8163WVacfdGmeobABr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>一年一度的阿那亚戏剧节，2025年我们仍旧未缺席。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我们采用了“零存整取”式录制，几乎每晚都会将今天所看的戏聊上一聊，这才汇齐了我们看过的全部剧目。但在剪辑过程中，被剪刀手删去了不少，但仍留下了不少好戏亟待与大家分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>请收听我们今年的阿那亚之旅~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 开幕大戏《唐璜》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 音乐戏剧《罗密欧与朱丽叶在鸡毛之地》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 肢体剧《荒唐人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 肢体剧《头脑中的魔怪》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1303">21:43</a> 环境戏剧朗读《渴求》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 英式喜剧《买单》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> 环境戏剧朗读《蔚蓝天空下 》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 环境戏剧朗读《女士们的游戏》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a> 环境戏剧朗读《送菜升降机》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 互动戏剧《画框》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3033">50:33</a> 环境戏剧朗读《细节》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3752">62:32</a> 环境戏剧朗读《大象沉默》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4061">67:41</a> 环境戏剧朗读《老塞布鲁克镇》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4463">74:23</a> 环境戏剧朗读《一句顶一万句》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4817">80:17</a> &nbsp;阿宁小总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5064">84:24</a> 环境戏剧朗读《当我说“我们”时我是在说我和你》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5308">88:28</a> 环境戏剧朗读《她弥留之际》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5584">93:04</a> 环境戏剧朗读《求证》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5751">95:51</a> 环境戏剧朗读《怀疑》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：玥玥</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：玥玥/阿宁/阿夏/过过/彬彬/阿吉/杰尼/咩咩</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：阿宁</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：彬彬</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Quadro Nuevo - Tu Vuo' Fa' L'americano</span></p><span></span><p><span>Herbert von Karajan Berliner Philharmoniker - The Swan Of Tuonela, Op.22, No.2</span></p><span></span><p><span>Otto A Totland - Enter</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpAbBYgbzGcw_e717oSm4n81JL6h.gif"></figure>]]></description>
