  <item>
    <title>Vol.63 编辑部的故事：《粉丝来信》《觉醒年代》大串门</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d7cc2e78103db3bde93e30</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d7cc2e78103db3bde93e30</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Mar 2025 07:26:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnskU6mNNql1aMw5ZG0-wS8HIdag.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这期播客录制于2024年8月，在那之前，《粉丝来信》与《觉醒年代》两部音乐剧轮流在北京上演，这两部大家都不陌生的戏，因为新卡的加入与熟面孔们的互串，让阿韭有了新鲜感和叭叭的欲望。《朝华》与《新青年》两个编辑部给我们带来过怎样的感动与共鸣，对卡司组合、改编呈现有哪些夸夸和批评，又是什么让主播纷纷哽咽难言、现场一片混乱？这期叭叭充满欢笑和猝不及防的泪水，很适合在这个万物萌动的季节收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「春天没有电报，就乘着车像窃贼一般地来临了。」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「你好，春天。」</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">1:54</a> 海派编辑赵伟钢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">8:43</a> 从1.0到2.0的《觉醒年代》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 姜崃、于晓璘、朱家鹏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> 《粉丝来信》与朝华编辑部</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a> 微岚、夏光、金海鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3830">1:03:50</a> 七人会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4407">1:13:27</a> 戏剧舞台上的文人气质</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：阿宁/彬彬/阿九/Yiran/玥玥/司北</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：司北/阿夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：阿九</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：Yiran</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gold Rays - Summer Kennedy</span></p>]]></description>
